~ solution_stage1
Get Mom and Dad into the hallway at the same time.
Then, in the astral plane, Nudge the pumpkin photo on the hallway wall so it falls.
=> END

~ solution_stage2
In the astral plane, Shock the TV in the living room while Dad is watching TV or the thermostat in the hall after chilling Dad, to send Dad to the garage.
While Mom drinks her coffee in the kitchen, Nudge her cup to spill it. She will take the laundry to the garage.
With both of them in the garage, Nudge the keepsake box.
=> END

~ solution_stage3
Before evening, knock over all three of Dad's beer cans in the living room so he has nothing to drink.
Hide Mom's pills in your parents' bedroom before she goes to bed.
After 11 PM, Nudge the Tool Rack in the garage to wake Dad, then go into their bedroom.
=> END

~ solution_stage4
Your room is too dark to see. Turn on your string lights by shocking the button, or wait until morning.
=> END

~ solution_stage4_step1
Look at the broken picture frame in the hallway again. The code for your diary is hidden there.
Then open your diary and read it to the last page.
=> END

~ solution_stage5
Go to the living room and face the creature. Accept it, then leave through the front door.
=> END